{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":642387,"ns":0,"title":"Adapter","extract":"An adapter or adaptor is a device that converts attributes of one electrical device or system to those of an otherwise incompatible device or system. Some modify power or signal attributes, while others merely adapt the physical form of one connector to another.","description":"Accessory for adapting or connecting two devices or two workpieces","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}